# Open source components

This register records software actually incorporated or adapted by the Archaic Web.

No external Gopher, Gemini or IRC repository is incorporated in v0.1. The first version consists only of repository-local Gemtext, Gopher text/menu files, and an ordinary-browser mirror.

Reference-only projects must not be listed as incorporated dependencies. When a component is adopted, record:

* project and upstream repository
* authors or maintainers where appropriate
* license
* version or commit
* files or functionality used
* modifications made
* location in this project
